      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea ghweelmeeda gweaydeesh",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea eaweeda madeeda bea sheedeaba ispwa gajea badoodeaba geat ghaydit jea eabwada ASEETA; majasna gadiyeeda wassean oosinayi. Nih eaweeda jea aghuudana durumbeati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak agooga gajoatayda haleanjeeda ghadooweeda jea eaghwarda ghoah shearooda ng'andit jea goohoosan NG'UTAMIIDA; heawagi mwanang', ea lagweenjeanjagi, ea dayi ispwa bea gisilga bea gwanyagi manda sirjeeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sea haleanjeadaanyi bea ghadooweeda was booga bea dearanga miyaasiin siikuuyi nagheeda, gideaba damanamughuush bea gilo damanamughuushcheew samwagu aba danyagi, ea gideaba damanamughuush bea damanamughuushcheew iyeenya aba lagweenda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gideaba damanamughuushcheanjagi aba giliwas dayeenda gisilleanda aba jeedeaba dayeegiga bea gisilga asispwaan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea ghwaranyagi ghoah haleanjeeda ghadooweeda aba badayda riing'eeda, ak gwasin giirooroocheeda aba badahuukeagwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gayghabwada haleanjeeni bea ghadooweeda sighwarda aba ng'ushiinda sheedean, ea haleanjeadaanyi bea ghadooweeda was booga, sea haleanjeeni bea ghadooweeda sigwariida bea galeagaseaniin, ea haleanjeadaanyi bea ghadooweeda was booga, sea haleanjeadaanyi bea ghadooweeda sileeha, gawuurji gidanyaashta diigheandaanyi, ak ghoah shearooda ng'andit, suh haleanjeeda ghadooweeda siitaw NG'UTAMIIDA sighwarda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
