            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eaweeteaba damanamughuush bea sheeni bea ispwaan gajea badoodeaba geat ghaydit jea eabwada ASEETA; majayaaga gil, ak ea majasna gadiyeeda wassean oosinayi, ",
          "type": "text",
