        },
        {
          "text": "sea haleanjeadaanyi bea ghadooweeda was dearanga, miyaasiin siikuuyi nagheeda, ghoah gideaba damanamughuush bea gilo aba giliwas damanamughuush bea damanamughuushcheew samwagu aba danyi, ea gideaba damanamughuush aba giliwas damanamughuush bea damanamughuushcheew iyeenya bea lagweenjeanji, ",
