        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak eaweeteaba damanamuut bea sheedeaba ispwa gajea badoodeaba geat ghaydit jea eabwada ASEETA; majasna gadiyeeda wassean oosinayi, ak gajasisiina ghweelmeeda NG'UTAMIIDA eawooji ispwa; ",
