          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gajoatayda haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda, was haleanjeeda ghadooweeda siitaydaawa beasta, ghoah shearooda ng'andit aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA; was heewsu manang'i damasamwagu, ea lagweendi iyeenya, ea dayeega gisilga was lagweendiga damanang'wan bea gwanyagi; ak gajea manda sirjeeda sean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.13"
            ]
