          "text": "“Haleanjeeni gajoatawa NG'UTAMIIDA aba ghweelmoojigeagwa ghayi sirukuneegwa, jea abwadana haleanjeedeang'wa oarachi, sea haleanjeedeang'wa bea ghadooweeda mwas jeesingeagwa, ghoah haleanjeedeang'wa bea ghadooweeda jea eaghwarda, ea haleanjeedeang'wa bea ghadooweeda was booga, ea haleanjeedeang'wa bea ghadooweeda sileeha, sea haleanjeedeang'wa bea ghadooweeda bea hoyyoo.”",
